- id: P:program/nested-in-loop
  type: program
  name: nested-in-loop
  summary: 'Every service the house sells, marked as the house says it and then as what it does now: the nested
    mark runs with each service, as part of its statement''s one node.'
  why: 'every service the house sells, marked as the house says it and then as what it does now: the nested mark
    runs with each service, as part of its statement''s one node.'
  must: []
  decided: []
  takes:
  - name: h
    type: volume
  gives:
  - name: i
    type: volume
  lines: 3-14
  order: 1
  body: |
    program nested-in-loop
      why: every service the house sells, marked as the house says it and then as what it does now:
           the nested mark runs with each service, as part of its statement's one node.

      takes h: volume                  -- the holotype
      gives i: volume                  -- an isotype

      for each o in h where kind is service
        emit mark (mark o as stated) as verified    -- one node: the inner mark is folded in
      end
      give project h as isotype
    end
  steps:
  - P:step/nested-in-loop.1
  - P:step/nested-in-loop.3
  provenance:
    mode: derived
